  "title": "Roasted Eggplant and Mushrooms",
  "description": "Eggplant, mushrooms, and zucchini are roasted together with a touch of tomato for a surprisingly robust side dish or sandwich filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Phoebe S. Spinrad"
  ],
